  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: new API, no breaking changes. Intercept inference: InterceptStandardError, InterceptPValue, InterceptConfidenceInterval (df = n - 2, Excel LINEST). Opt-in population (N) variance and standard deviation: VarianceXPopulation, VarianceYPopulation, StdDevXPopulation, StdDevYPopulation (Excel VAR.P/STDEV.P); defaults stay n - 1. Fixed: tiny p-values no longer round to 0 (2*CDF(-|t|)); Dec after removing a far-away point now restores the statistics (double-double streaming sums). XML docs for every public member. Full notes: https://github.com/NinerXrayBravoTwoTwo/linear-regression-pvalues/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
